  partName: Exhaust Manifold Bolt
  description: The Exhaust Manifold Bolt is a tiny, elongated component positioned
    at the bottom-center-rear of the engine, made of Material.001, which secures
    the exhaust manifold in place. Its small size and rear location ensure a tight
    connection, and an interesting detail is that it is designed to withstand high
    temperatures and vibrations.
